OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing to address slavery in Antigua as
OL,4,APM says he is open to possible UK
OL,5,Aapology
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham earlier
OL,8,Fwrote in the Guardian that he was
OL,9,F"open" to the possibility of the UK
OL,10,Fformally apologising for its role in
OL,11,Fslavery - a change in the government's
OL,12,Fstance.
OL,14,FIt is understood the Palace was told in
OL,15,Fadvance of Burnham's comments in an
OL,16,Fopinion piece on Friday night, and that
OL,17,Fthe King has not made any changes to
OL,18,Fhis speech in light of them.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
